docs {
  # Get Total HKI
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/capaian/stats/hki`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil statistik HKI",
    "data": {
      "total": 50,
      "breakdown": {
        "Paten": 10,
        "Hak Cipta": 25,
        "Merek": 10,
        "Desain Industri": 5
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
